@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam titleBorderColor #000000
skinparam titleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam titleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #000000
    BoxBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    GroupBorderColor #000000
    GroupHeaderFontColor #000000
    GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerBorderColor #000000
    DividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerFontColor #000000
    DividerFontSize 12
    DividerFontStyle bold
}

title Sequence Diagram: Memeriksa Riwayat Transaksi (UC-08)

actor "Audio Engineer" as User

box "Presentation Layer (Frontend)"
boundary "Riwayat Transaksi / Dompet\n(Web UI)" as UI
end box

box "Application & Business Logic Layer (Backend API)"
control "TransactionController\n(API Gateway)" as TxCtrl
control "AuthMiddleware\n(JWT Guard)" as AuthGuard
entity "LedgerService\n(Audit & Query Core)" as LedgerSvc
entity "PdfExportService\n(Receipt Generator)" as PdfSvc
end box

box "Persistence Layer"
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
end box

autonumber 1 "[00]"

== Fase 1: Memuat Daftar Riwayat Mutasi Token (Default View) ==

User -> UI : Pilih tab "Riwayat Transaksi" pada menu Dompet Token
activate User
activate UI

UI -> TxCtrl : GET /api/v1/wallet/transactions?page=1&limit=10 (Bearer JWT)
activate TxCtrl

TxCtrl -> AuthGuard : validateSession(token)
activate AuthGuard
AuthGuard --> TxCtrl : SessionValid (user_id)
deactivate AuthGuard

TxCtrl -> LedgerSvc : getTransactionHistory(user_id, page=1, limit=10)
activate LedgerSvc

LedgerSvc -> DB : SELECT * FROM token_ledgers WHERE user_id = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 10
activate DB
DB --> LedgerSvc : Data catatan mutasi (Top-up, Pemakaian Sesi, Refund)
deactivate DB

LedgerSvc --> TxCtrl : TransactionHistoryData (records, pagination)
deactivate LedgerSvc

TxCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (transactions_list, pagination_meta)
deactivate TxCtrl

UI --> User : Render tabel riwayat transaksi (Tanggal, Jenis, Jumlah Token, Saldo Akhir)
deactivate UI

== Fase 2: Menyaring Riwayat Berdasarkan Kategori (Filter History) ==

User -> UI : Pilih filter kategori (misal: "Top-up", "Pemakaian Sesi", atau "Refund")
activate UI
User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Terapkan Filter"

UI -> TxCtrl : GET /api/v1/wallet/transactions?type=CREDIT_TOPUP&page=1
activate TxCtrl

TxCtrl -> LedgerSvc : getFilteredTransactions(user_id, filter_type='CREDIT_TOPUP')
activate LedgerSvc

LedgerSvc -> DB : SELECT * FROM token_ledgers WHERE user_id = ? AND type = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DB
DB --> LedgerSvc : Hasil filter catatan mutasi
deactivate DB

LedgerSvc --> TxCtrl : FilteredHistoryData
deactivate LedgerSvc

TxCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (filtered_records)
deactivate TxCtrl

UI --> User : Perbarui tampilan tabel dengan daftar transaksi terfilter
deactivate UI

== Fase 3: Pemeriksaan Rincian Transaksi & Unduh Tanda Terima ==

User -> UI : Klik salah satu baris transaksi untuk melihat rincian
activate UI

UI -> TxCtrl : GET /api/v1/wallet/transactions/{id}/details
activate TxCtrl

TxCtrl -> LedgerSvc : getTransactionDetail(user_id, transaction_id)
activate LedgerSvc

LedgerSvc -> DB : SELECT tl.*, o.gateway_ref, s.track_count FROM token_ledgers tl LEFT JOIN orders o ON tl.order_id = o.id LEFT JOIN sessions s ON tl.session_id = s.id WHERE tl.id = ?
activate DB
DB --> LedgerSvc : Rincian lengkap transaksi (ID, trek, referensi pembayaran, stempel waktu)
deactivate DB

LedgerSvc --> TxCtrl : TransactionDetailData
deactivate LedgerSvc

TxCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (transaction_detail)
deactivate TxCtrl

UI --> User : Tampilkan modal panel rincian transaksi
deactivate UI

alt Tindakan: Mengunduh Bukti Pembayaran Digital (Invoice / Receipt PDF)
  User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Unduh Tanda Terima"
  activate UI

  UI -> TxCtrl : GET /api/v1/wallet/transactions/{id}/receipt
  activate TxCtrl

  TxCtrl -> PdfSvc : generateReceiptPdf(user_id, transaction_id)
  activate PdfSvc

  PdfSvc -> DB : SELECT * FROM token_ledgers tl JOIN orders o ON tl.order_id = o.id WHERE tl.id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> PdfSvc : Data validasi faktur transaksi
  deactivate DB

  PdfSvc -> PdfSvc : Render template PDF kuitansi resmi studio & metadata
  PdfSvc --> TxCtrl : Binary PDF Stream (receipt_INV_XXXX.pdf)
  deactivate PdfSvc

  TxCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (Content-Type: application/pdf)
  deactivate TxCtrl

  UI --> User : Simpan / unduh berkas tanda terima digital (PDF) ke perangkat
  deactivate UI

else Tindakan: Menutup Panel Rincian
  User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Tutup" pada panel modal
  activate UI
  UI --> User : Tutup modal dan kembalikan fokus ke tabel riwayat transaksi
  deactivate UI
end

deactivate User

@enduml
